---
description: Audio recorder backend rules for anoted
globs: internal/recorder/**,tools/windows-recorder/**
alwaysApply: false
---

All audio backends must implement the same `Recorder` interface.

- Never invoke external commands (ffmpeg, pw-cat, etc.) directly from the TUI.
- Encapsulate external tools inside `internal/recorder` implementations.
- Validate dependencies in `anoted doctor`; degrade gracefully with clear messages.
- WSL2 must use the native Windows helper (`tools/windows-recorder`) for real capture.
- Design backends so WASAPI/C++ helpers can be swapped without changing the TUI.
